{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "homelab-truenas",
  "title": "TrueNAS",
  "description": "TrueNAS CORE (Voyager) from its collectd Graphite stream (job=\"truenas\", names servers_Voyager_local_*) and its syslog. The names are CORE's; a move to SCALE changes them. docs/design/host-monitoring.md.",
